  "subject": "Webda.io - Email registration",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<head>\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n<title>Webda.io - Email Validation</title>\n<link href=\"styles.css\" media=\"all\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n<style>\n@font-face {\n  font-family: 'Roboto';\n  font-style: normal;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  font-stretch: normal;\n  src: url(https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/roboto/v51/KFOMCnqEu92Fr1ME7kSn66aGLdTylUAMQXC89YmC2DPNWubEbVmUiA8.ttf) format('truetype');\n}\n\n</style>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"EmailMessage\",\n  \"potentialAction\": {\n    \"@type\": \"ConfirmAction\",\n    \"name\": \"Confirm Email\",\n    \"handler\":  {\n       \"@type\": \"HttpActionHandler\",\n       \"url\": \"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;x.io&#x2F;a?b&#x3D;1&amp;c&#x3D;2\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n</script>\n</head>\n\n<body itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/EmailMessage\">\n<table class=\"body-wrap\">\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td></td>\n\t\t<td class=\"container\" width=\"600\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<table class=\"main\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"alert header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr class=\"firstline\" valign=\"bottom\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td><img src=\"http://webda.io/images/logo.png\"></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"title\">Webda<span class=\"orange\">.io</span> - Email Validation</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"content-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"content-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTo validate your email <strong></strong> you need to click on the button below.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"content-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThis is the default email template from Webda.io, you should customize it by adding a template named PASSPORT_EMAIL_REGISTER\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"content-block\" align=\"right\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;x.io&#x2F;a?b&#x3D;1&amp;c&#x3D;2\" class=\"btn-primary\">Confirm my email</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"footer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<table width=\"100%\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"aligncenter content-block\">Take a look at <a href=\"http://webda.io\">webda.io</a></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t</td>\n\t\t<td></td>\n\t</tr>\n</table>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n",
  "text": "To validate your email  you need to click on the button below.\n\nThis is the default email template from Webda.io, you should customize it by adding a template named PASSPORT_EMAIL_REGISTER\n\nLink: https:&#x2F;&#x2F;x.io&#x2F;a?b&#x3D;1&amp;c&#x3D;2"
